      "improving": "IMPROVED"
    },
    "direction_from_ordinal_rule": "If both reference_level and main_level normalize to ordinal numbers: main > reference -> WORSENED; main < reference -> IMPROVED; equal -> SAME_LEVEL. If not comparable but directional keyword exists, use keyword. Otherwise LEVEL_CHANGED_UNSPECIFIED.",
    "messy_level_handling": "For strings containing multiple severity tokens, use the maximum ordinal token for conservative severity, and store raw value for Level-Value evaluation."
  },
